				<wikidot:authorName>Karmadon</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1374516</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Movement of SCP-2383-J is to be <strong>done</strong> by robotic means.</p> </blockquote> <p>Already mentioned this to you</p> <blockquote> <p>unless storage is approved by the overseeing Level 4 researcher</p> </blockquote> <p>What Level 4 researcher? Mention him beforehand</p> <blockquote> <p>When a subject enters the effective range</p> </blockquote> <p>What effective range? <strong>YOU ARE TEARING ME APART, LISA</strong></p> <blockquote> <p>as such, testing of SCP-2383-J requires approval by at least two Level 4 researchers.</p> </blockquote> <p>This should be in the containment procedures</p> <blockquote> <p>While the subject is engaged in experimentation</p> </blockquote> <p>No actual description of experimentation is given beforehand</p> <blockquote> <p>SCP-2383-J is put down, and retains the colored liquid inside</p> </blockquote> <p>Who cares? It only empties once the experiment is over, right?</p> <blockquote> <p>Any tests where the subject causes SCP-2383-J to create a red liquid are to immediately enact protocol 2383-Rho.</p> </blockquote> <p>Containment procedures!</p> <blockquote> <p>Dr. Aeish</p> </blockquote> <p>Obvious self inserts are annoying</p> 
				 	]]>
